ZLCompressor for WebCLAP (ports/zl-compressor): its window in the style of openDAW's device panels
(docs/device-panel-design.md): state_definitions.hpp, the editor's default colours; interface_definitons.cpp, flat surfaces (the shadow helpers draw no shadows, a recessed area is a flat
darker screen); two_value_rotary_slider.hpp, openDAW's knob (a faint track around a dark cap, the value as an
arc and a pointer in the label cream).

